# ⇧⌘D bookmarks the page (bookmarks.json) and opens its card; View Bookmarks… opens the Library's
# Bookmarks page as a ~400 pt drawer over the page; a relaunch keeps the bookmark.
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=bookmark
wait 3
cra://action/bookmarkTab
wait 1
expect-log bookmark added
expect-log bookmark card shows added
cra://action/viewBookmarks
wait 1.5
cra://debug?windowState=bookmarks
expect-log window state bookmarks: main0 .*docked=1 floating=0 drawer=400 library=bookmarks
relaunch
wait 3
cra://action/viewBookmarks
wait 1
expect-log bookmarks: 1 loaded
